Congestion Recovery

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

Congestion Recovery is an open-source, vendor-neutral C++20 runtime for
generation-bound recovery governance after congestion intervention: staged
restoration, hysteresis, revalidation, compensating rollback and recovery
authority.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Congestion Recovery does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Congestion Recovery accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
